        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adindeawi aseecheeka suuk geakghusan aniini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adisissi geaw sanaamu, ghana gisigala gida wassean mida humng'eeda ghana gida wassean mida badayda ng'eanyiida, ghana gida wassean mida jeeda beega aba badayda ng'eanyiida ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aditkuyi aba madeenyaawa, ghana gadiyeesiina saawa, aba gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, ak ea ASEETA lacha ghuut haleanjeeda, ak gaygwasikteawa diibiga aba giidiinyeanyeeka ghweaniga nyaawa, ea ghwahita seaygeedeaba samwagu ea deaba ang'wan bea fuga anyareesean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghaabwaydi fih sagalamnyooji sagalama bwariinyan, nea ghoang'waay diigheanyeekeasu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adirugu mwadaagha gheawunga NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA mayghwanung' ghoah gilimandeawana ramaseanda siidida ruku gheawungaaschi mwadaaghaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
