          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwadaah buuneesean dadamandeeda ea gighweendandeeda, ea ghuuta durumbeateeda haw ea aroosta rinna uhuudeaba giijeedida hean daa buuneeda ng'asheesu geabeal nea geaboadan ak geamiinaada nea sheagi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak geeyeesha Musa, “Abalooleasa ang'iing'i ak gajeeleeyseey iit, sighus ASEETA adagoobalooleasa gajiidu geemeewayi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Musa ak gwayeesha buuneeda, “Adoabeali aba gideaba ASEETA ghwahidu gwasimeegwa nea ghwahidu madeedeang'wa gharbeadaanyi ak abeeda ea moosini riing'eeda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
