            "sid": "EXO 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamiinaada buuneeda nea sheagi, ak gwaneekiisa Musa misaneedida mida jeeda ASEETEAN.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Deaweedajeega aba badayda heeda wagiida",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Musa, “Eeshiina fuga Israeli, ‘Agooga noadaayi gideabalooldaneegwa aba humng'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoosinyi aseecheeka sisna lapiya jea dandeayi sea aniini, ghana adoosisi geat aseecheeka sisna dahaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sinnean heeda wagiida sisna sheang'weeda ak giidaydi lukghumeadaang'u aba badaydaanyi ea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea hoyyoo, ea gisilgaagu ea dugwaagu, hiji was sean jea dayiin giipkeata gheawungeasu gaydahidu headaang'u ak geagoonyeeyi ghawooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak inyas gisinnean heeda wagiida aba lagheanga, abeeda ea maysinana lagheanga sishit, aba gideaba inyas gishti nea gigadiyeati dabicheandaang'u abeeda ea ning'udi ririnnyeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea mayding'deawana gidingeenda una heeda wagiideanyu, aba gideaba gayghwadaajiit dawiishnataang'u.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
